{"sourceUrl":"https://highway.chd.edu.cn/info/1014/24585.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.082933+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://highway.chd.edu.cn/info/1014/24585.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>一、招生专业</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>公路学院硕士招生专业一览表</span></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>硕士类型</span></strong></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>专业</span></strong></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>研究方向</span></strong></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"7\"><p><span>学硕</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>081400</span></p><p><span>土木工程</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01桥梁工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>02隧道工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>03岩土工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>04防灾减灾工程及防护工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>082300</span><span><br/>   </span><span>交通运输工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01道路与机场工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>02路线工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>0823Z7</span><span><br/>   </span><span>交通能源融合工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>00不区分研究方向</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>专硕</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>085900</span><span><br/>   </span><span>土木水利</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01桥梁工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>/</span><span>非全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>02隧道与岩土工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>/</span><span>非全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>03防灾减灾工程及防护工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>/</span><span>非全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>086100</span><span><br/>   </span><span>交通运输</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01道路与机场工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>/</span><span>非全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>02道路总体工程</span><span><br/>     (</span><span>全日制</span><span>/</span><span>非全日制</span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>公路学院博士招生专业一览表(直博生）</span></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>081401</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>岩土工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>081406</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>桥梁与隧道工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>082301</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>道路与铁道工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>0823Z7</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>交通能源融合工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>085900</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>土木水利</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>086100</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>交通运输</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span>二、复试对象</span></p>\n<p><span>未参加我院第一批推免生复试的全国各高校硕士推免生及本校推免生。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、复试方式和内容</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>复试方式：</span></strong><span>复试采用线上面试的方式进行，采用软件为</span><span>“</span><span>腾讯会议</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span>复试内容：</span></strong><span>主要对推免生的专业综合能力、外语口语及听力、思想政治素质等进行考核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>四、申请程序</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>（一）长安大学推免生预报名系统报名</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>2026年9月19日前，凡有意报考我院2027年推荐免试研究生的申请人登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（https://yzfw.chd.edu.cn:9091/xly/），填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>附件材料要求：</span></strong><span>申请人请将以下材料按照顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传推免生预报名系统。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明(由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章)；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.英语水平证明材料（CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等成绩单）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></p>\n<p><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>（二）复试时间及报名方式</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.复试时间：2026年9月19日上午9：00开始</span></p>\n<p><span>2.报名时间：2026年9月16日-18日12:00前</span></p>\n<p><span>3.报名方式：</span></p>\n<p><span>点击下面链接（或扫码）进入腾讯文档填写报名统计表</span></p>\n<p><span>【腾讯文档】公路学院招收2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）第二批次面试报名统计表</span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DSnJHY2lQUU5EdlZm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DSnJHY2lQUU5EdlZm</a> </span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://highway.chd.edu.cn/__local/8/E5/C4/9E66A6FC4123B9A2A3D514BF7C3_8FE16763_1B553.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>五、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：葛老师</span></p>\n<p><span>地 址：陕西省西安市长安大学北校区公路学院208室</span></p>\n<p><span>电 话：029-611065</span><span>30</span></p>\n<p><span>六、其他事项</span></p>\n<p><span>1.申请人须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，若经查实存在学术不端或申报材料弄虚作假情形，均按相关规定取消拟录取或录取资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.有意向申请我院2027年研究生的推免生请务必及时加入QQ群：768954877，后续复试分组具体安排将在群内发布。<br/></span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://highway.chd.edu.cn/__local/7/F9/5F/B5CB88BD44FA4107CA06A2979FD_FB1110B1_2097.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>3.其他未尽事宜，按照长安大学研究生招生相关文件及学院补充通知执行。</span></p>\n<p><span>（1）长安大学2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生简章</span></p>\n<p><span>     https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2026/0908/c2769a262545/page.htm</span></p>\n<p><span>（2）长安大学公路学院2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生工作细则</span></p>\n<p><span>      </span><span>  https://highway.chd.edu.cn/info/1014/24581.htm</span></p>\n<p><span>（3）长安大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知</span></p>\n<p><span>          </span><span>https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2026/0723/c2769a262101/page.htm</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>长安大学公路学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026年9月16日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"3c5595263a8812164ab7a2f468ce4c0c59dceda9d9bfcd22f6601236e18fddce","textLength":1462,"sourceSha256":"0f263d9480751518ee5e8b88f55dd678014189bd8d43a94b02b2427174a16c58","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3b888934ff78eba8d4c0","title":"2026年长安大学公路学院招收2027年硕士推免生（含直博生）复试通知（第二批）","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.082933+00:00"}
